WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.700
<v Narrator>Narrator: This is Eco Town. Florence the robot is planning it.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.660
<v Florence>Florence: Here! Flat, wide and right by the river. I am 82% sure!

3
00:00:09.258 --> 00:00:11.928
<v Florence>Florence: Strong? I know strong! Concrete and steel!

4
00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:15.548
<v Florence>Florence: I am 90% sure. That is very, very sure!

5
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.033
Sure is not the same as right.

6
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.190
<v Dev>Dev: Look through the flood lens! The meadow floods every winter.

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.770
<v Dev>Dev: The carbon lens! Making all that concrete gave off three times too much carbon.

8
00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:33.003
<v Dev>Dev: The nature lens shows it. No hedges. So the bees and the deer have left.

9
00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:36.793
<v Dev>Dev: The winter test! Look. Every light has gone out.

10
00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:39.273
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. But I was 90% sure!

11
00:00:39.783 --> 00:00:41.783
Catch the AI. With evidence.

12
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.930
<v Florence>Florence: An orchard, beehives and hedges. Enough for everyone. Checked!

13
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:49.070
<v Dev>Dev: Test it again. The lights stay on!

14
00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:56.545
<v Narrator>Narrator: And sure is not the same as right. So test the plan.
